TO GO AND SAY IT TO THEM.

650
00:23:54,867 --> 00:23:55,935
AND YOU DON'T GO SAY IT TO THEM.

651
00:23:55,935 --> 00:23:57,436
AND THAT'S WHY I DON'T LIKE YOU.

652
00:23:57,436 --> 00:23:59,104
