656
00:24:03,008 --> 00:24:05,644
Kelle: I'M JUST LIKE,
"WHOO-HOO, OKAY, I'M SORRY,

657
00:24:05,644 --> 00:24:07,146
BUT WE REALLY DON'T
HAVE TIME TO TALK.

658
00:24:07,146 --> 00:24:09,648
