WE GET TO THE YACHT,
WE GO UPSTAIRS.

666
00:24:28,867 --> 00:24:31,537
AND THEY HAVE ALL OF THESE COOL
HAND SANDWICHES.

667
00:24:31,537 --> 00:24:32,171
OOH!

668
00:24:32,171 --> 00:24:33,305
Man: I CAN ALSO BRING YOU
SOMETHING TO DRINK,

669
00:24:33,305 --> 00:24:33,973
IF YOU'D LIKE.

670
00:24:33,973 --> 00:24:35,474
Eva: WATERS
ALL THE WAY AROUND.

671
00:24:41,947 --> 00:24:44,216
Eva: IT WAS REALLY COOL
TO JUST BE OUTSIDE THE HOUSE

672
00:24:44,216 --> 00:24:45,250
AND SIT AND RELAX.

673
00:24:46,785 --> 00:24:48,087
Yoanna: AMBER VALETTA.

674
00:24:48,087 --> 00:24:49,421
Eva: SHE HAS A CAMPAIGN
WITH LOUIS VUITTON.

675
00:24:49,421 --> 00:24:50,990
Yoanna: SHE'S HAD
A LOT OF CAMPAIGNS.

676
00:24:50,990 --> 00:24:52,658
Eva: WHO'S THAT?
Yoanna: INEZ.

677
00:24:56,829 --> 00:24:58,564
Ann: IT WAS GOOD
TO MEET YOANNA

678
00:24:58,564 --> 00:25:01,000
AND TALK TO HER LIKE I TALK
TO ANY OF MY FRIENDS.

679
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:02,401
Yoanna: WHAT KIND OF SHOES
ARE THOSE?

680
00:25:02,401 --> 00:25:03,369
Ann: THESE?

681
00:25:03,369 --> 00:25:05,804
Eva: ANN IS EXCITED
TO BE WITH YOANNA. SHE LOVED IT.

682
00:25:05,804 --> 00:25:07,239
AND SHE'S EXTREMELY STARSTRUCK,
BUT SHE'S FROM

683
00:25:07,239 --> 00:25:08,540
ERIE, PENNSYLVANIA.

684
00:25:12,011 --> 00:25:14,780
Amanda: I JUST FEEL BETTER
RIGHT NOW.

685
00:25:14,780 --> 00:25:16,215
Yaya: YOU FEEL BETTER?
Amanda: MM-HMM.

686
00:25:16,215 --> 00:25:17,616
Yaya: GOOD.
Amanda: I FOUND MY CRYSTALS.

687
00:25:17,616 --> 00:25:19,351
Yaya: YOU FOUND THEM?!

688
00:25:19,351 --> 00:25:20,786
YOU'RE ALL SECRETIVE ABOUT IT.
Nicole: WHERE WERE THEY?

689
00:25:20,786 --> 00:25:23,455
Amanda: I'M AN IDIOT.
I HID 'EM LAST NIGHT.

690
00:25:23,455 --> 00:25:25,391
I HID THEM SO THEY WOULDN'T
GET STOLEN.

691
00:25:29,328 --> 00:25:33,365
I FEEL, LIKE, REALLY SILLY
FOR, LIKE, ACCUSING SOMEBODY

692
00:25:33,365 --> 00:25:35,834
OF THEFT WITHOUT HAVING
ANY PROOF.

693
00:25:35,834 --> 00:25:37,269
Eva: HOLD ON, NO,
I DIDN'T FIGURE THIS OUT.

694
00:25:37,269 --> 00:25:39,938
UNLESS YOU HAVE PROOF, DON'T SAY
I TOOK ANYTHING FROM YOU.

695
00:25:39,938 --> 00:25:41,607
Amanda: OKAY,
THAT WAS WRONG OF ME TO, LIKE,

696
00:25:41,607 --> 00:25:43,342
JUMP TO A CONCLUSION, BUT...

697
00:25:43,342 --> 00:25:44,076
Eva: ALL I KNOW--
Amanda: I JUST FIND IT

698
00:25:44,076 --> 00:25:46,612
KIND OF ODD THAT, YOU KNOW,
MINE THAT WAS THE ONLY STUFF

699
00:25:46,612 --> 00:25:48,047
THAT ISN'T EVEN ANYWHERE.

700
00:25:48,047 --> 00:25:48,714
YOU KNOW?

701
00:25:48,714 --> 00:25:51,183
Eva: HAVE YOU EVER THOUGHT THAT
YOU MIGHT'VE MISPLACED THEM?

702
00:25:51,183 --> 00:25:53,819
HAVE YOU EVER THOUGHT
IT MIGHT'VE BEEN ON YOU?

703
00:25:53,819 --> 00:25:56,388
Amanda: HEY, IF YOU ACCEPT
AN APOLOGY, I'LL MAKE IT SAYING,

704
00:25:56,388 --> 00:25:57,523
"SORRY I ASSUMED SOMETHING."

705
00:25:57,523 --> 00:25:59,091
Ann: SO LET'S JUST DROP IT
AT THAT. YAY!

706
00:25:59,091 --> 00:25:59,892
Amanda: YAY!

707
00:25:59,892 --> 00:26:00,826
Eva: I'M NOT A THIEF.

708
00:26:00,826 --> 00:26:02,795
I MAY BE LOUD,
BUT I'M NOT A THIEF.

709
00:26:06,465 --> 00:26:09,668
Yaya: TYRA MAIL.
"CAN YOU STAND OUT IN A CROWD?

710
00:26:09,668 --> 00:26:12,371
BE READY AT 8:30
IN THE MORNING."

711
00:26:12,371 --> 00:26:13,505
Women: WHOO!

712
00:26:13,505 --> 00:26:16,008
Woman: ♪ CONFUSION ♪♪

713
00:26:16,008 --> 00:26:18,010
Toccara: WE GET THIS TYRA MAIL
AND IT SAYS,

714
00:26:18,010 --> 00:26:21,713
"CAN YOU STAND OUT IN A CROWD?
BE READY AT 8:30."

715
00:26:29,521 --> 00:26:34,660
Jay: TODAY YOU GUYS WILL BE
IN A GROUP SHOT

716
00:26:34,660 --> 00:26:38,931
DOING A SHOOT FOR LEE JEANS,
AND YOU GUYS WILL BE WEARING

717
00:26:38,931 --> 00:26:41,600
LEE JEANS AND NOTHING ELSE.

718
00:26:41,600 --> 00:26:43,035
Women: WHOO!

719
00:26:44,303 --> 00:26:45,571
Kristi: I KNEW THAT THERE
WOULD BE A TIME

720
00:26:45,571 --> 00:26:46,872
