IS NOT GONNA LIKE IT VERY MUCH.

722
00:26:50,075 --> 00:26:51,510
Jay: HERE'S THE REAL
COOL PART--

723
00:26:51,510 --> 00:26:54,446
THIS LEE JEANS
DOUBLE-PAGE SPREAD IS GOING

724
00:26:54,446 --> 00:26:58,450
TO APPEAR AS AN ADVERTISEMENT
IN "PEOPLE" MAGAZINE.

725
00:26:58,450 --> 00:27:00,219
Women: WHOO! YAY!

726
00:27:00,219 --> 00:27:03,522
Jay: YOUR PHOTOGRAPHER TODAY
IS SO TALENTED. I LOVE HIM.

727
00:27:03,522 --> 00:27:04,756
HIS NAME IS HYUNGWAN ROO.

728
00:27:04,756 --> 00:27:06,391
HYUNGWAN,
COULD YOU COME OVER HERE?

729
00:27:06,391 --> 00:27:08,093
Hyungwan: EVERYBODY NEEDS
TO BE SORT OF "ON"

730
00:27:08,093 --> 00:27:08,961
AT THE SAME TIME.

731
00:27:08,961 --> 00:27:11,797
SO I JUST NEED
YOUR UNDIVIDED ATTENTION.

732
00:27:11,797 --> 00:27:14,533
Jay: WE'RE ACTUALLY GONNA
SHOOT YOU GUYS IN TWO GROUPS

733
00:27:14,533 --> 00:27:17,803
OF SIX AND FIVE
AND COMPOSITE THEM TOGETHER.

734
00:27:17,803 --> 00:27:18,871
ALL RIGHT?
Women: ALL RIGHT.

735
00:27:18,871 --> 00:27:20,973
Jay: ALL RIGHT,
SO LET'S GET STARTED.

736
00:27:20,973 --> 00:27:23,308
Eva: WHEN WE'RE IN THE HOUSE,
THAT'S NOT THE COMPETITION.

737
00:27:23,308 --> 00:27:26,078
WHEN WE GET ON THAT SET,
THAT IS THE COMPETITION.

738
00:27:30,782 --> 00:27:32,151
Cassie: MAKE ME LOOK SEXY.

739
00:27:32,151 --> 00:27:33,218
