744
00:27:44,363 --> 00:27:46,532
Kristi: WHOO.

745
00:27:46,532 --> 00:27:47,799
Jay: DON'T WORRY.

746
00:27:47,799 --> 00:27:49,968
THE GIRLS CLEARLY HAD
