753
00:28:02,781 --> 00:28:05,450
I WAS TRYING TO ACT
ALL COMFORTABLE AND CONFIDENT

754
00:28:05,450 --> 00:28:07,119
WHEN I TOTALLY WAS NOT.

755
00:28:10,956 --> 00:28:12,124
Jay: OH, ANN, WOW.

756
00:28:12,124 --> 00:28:13,258
THERE'S A GOOD ONE.

757
00:28:13,258 --> 00:28:15,027
Amanda: (laughs)

758
00:28:15,027 --> 00:28:16,495
