JUST A LITTLE BIT.

760
00:28:17,329 --> 00:28:18,330
Kristi: ALL THE WAY THIS WAY?

761
00:28:18,330 --> 00:28:19,398
Hyungwan: NO,
THAT'S TOO MUCH.

762
00:28:19,398 --> 00:28:22,668
