764
00:28:24,736 --> 00:28:25,604
IT OUT.

765
00:28:25,604 --> 00:28:27,306
HEY, KELLE...

766
00:28:27,306 --> 00:28:28,207
DON'T DO THIS.

767
00:28:28,207 --> 00:28:30,008
Kelle: OKAY.

768
00:28:30,008 --> 00:28:32,277
Jay: HEY, NICOLE,
