770
00:28:33,879 --> 00:28:36,081
ARE YOU GUYS LISTENING?
DON'T LOSE IT.

771
00:28:36,081 --> 00:28:38,016
Ann: AND TO THINK WE ALL
THOUGHT THIS WAS EASY.

772
00:28:40,052 --> 00:28:43,222
Hyungwan: GREAT!
Women: WHOO! YES!

773
00:28:43,222 --> 00:28:44,823
