00:29:04,076 --> 00:29:05,444
Hyungwan: NORELLE,
COVER YOUR BREAST

781
00:29:05,444 --> 00:29:07,279
JUST A LITTLE BIT BETTER.

782
00:29:07,279 --> 00:29:09,615
Jay: JENNIPHER,
CAN YOU TURN YOUR HEAD A LITTLE

783
00:29:09,615 --> 00:29:11,183
TO FACE THE CAMERA?

784
00:29:11,183 --> 00:29:12,417
Jennipher: WHEN WE
DO PHOTO SHOOTS,

785
00:29:12,417 --> 00:29:14,253
IF IT FEELS UNCOMFORTABLE,
IT'S PROBABLY RIGHT.

786
00:29:14,253 --> 00:29:15,087
Jay: UGH.

787
00:29:15,087 --> 00:29:17,289
Hyungwan: YOUR UPPER BODY,
JUST ANGLE THE WHOLE THING.

788
00:29:17,289 --> 00:29:18,824
YAYA, YOU'RE GREAT.

789
00:29:18,824 --> 00:29:20,158
Jay: WHAT HAPPENED
TO NORELLE?

790
00:29:20,158 --> 00:29:22,995
DON'T FORGET THAT PROFILE.

791
00:29:22,995 --> 00:29:24,663
YOU GUYS ROCKED.

792
00:29:24,663 --> 00:29:26,932
GOOD JOB TODAY.
I'M REALLY SURPRISED.

793
00:29:26,932 --> 00:29:28,800
SO THROW YOUR TOPS ON.

794
00:29:31,236 --> 00:29:32,537
Jay: NORELLE...

795
00:29:32,537 --> 00:29:35,107
WAS TRYING TO SHOW ME
HOW GORGEOUS HER BOOBS WERE,

796
00:29:35,107 --> 00:29:36,241
WHICH THEY ARE.

797
00:29:36,241 --> 00:29:37,976
IF SHE'S GOT GORGEOUS BOOBS
THAT DOESN'T MEAN SHE'S GOING

798
00:29:37,976 --> 00:29:39,878
TO BE AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

799
00:29:43,448 --> 00:29:45,517
Kelle: WE'VE GOT TYRA MAIL!
Eva: TYRA MAIL!

800
00:29:45,517 --> 00:29:47,653
Kelle: TOMORROW YOU MEET
THE JUDGES.

801
00:29:47,653 --> 00:29:50,589
ONLY TEN OF YOU WILL CONTINUE
ON HOPES OF BECOMING

802
00:29:50,589 --> 00:29:52,624
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

803
00:29:52,624 --> 00:29:54,526
ONE OF YOU
WILL BE ELIMINATED."

804
00:29:59,064 --> 00:30:01,400
Kristi: YOANNA SAID
TO NOT PAY ATTENTION

805
00:30:01,400 --> 00:30:03,435
TO THE OTHER GIRLS.
DON'T GET DISTRACTED.

806
00:30:03,435 --> 00:30:05,270
I DON'T GOOF OFF AT ALL.

807
00:30:05,270 --> 00:30:08,006
BUT IN THIS SITUATION I HAVE
FELT TOTALLY OUT OF CONTROL.

808
00:30:08,006 --> 00:30:10,475
Eva: MY PRIORITIES
ARE TO WIN THIS COMPETITION,

809
00:30:10,475 --> 00:30:11,643
AND I'M GONNA WIN IT.

810
00:30:11,643 --> 00:30:13,478
WHAT IF I GOT ELIMINATED?

811
00:30:13,478 --> 00:30:15,213
WOW, WOULDN'T THAT BE A SHOCKER?

812
00:30:20,352 --> 00:30:22,754
Norelle: I MIGHT BE AT
A DISADVANTAGE BECAUSE I DID,

813
00:30:22,754 --> 00:30:23,989
LIKE, FALL.

814
00:30:23,989 --> 00:30:26,325
