815
00:30:26,325 --> 00:30:28,493
I'M HERE, LIKE,
TO WIN THE COMPETITION.

816
00:30:28,493 --> 00:30:30,796
IT BOTHERS ME.
LIKE, I DON'T WANNA GO HOME.

817
00:30:43,608 --> 00:30:46,011
Jennipher: WE HAVE
AN ELIMINATION TONIGHT.

818
00:30:46,011 --> 00:30:47,946
AND, YEAH, I'M KINDA NERVOUS.

819
00:30:47,946 --> 00:30:49,715
I FEEL THAT I'M GONNA
MAKE IT REALLY FAR IN THIS,

820
00:30:49,715 --> 00:30:52,584
AND THAT'S HOW I THINK
IT'S GONNA PLAY OUT FOR ME.

821
00:30:52,584 --> 00:30:55,554
Amanda: WE ALL KNOW THAT
WE COULD MODEL.

822
00:30:55,554 --> 00:30:58,623
BUT ARE WE GOOD ENOUGH
TO BE AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL?

823
00:31:07,733 --> 00:31:09,801
Tyra: SO THIS WEEK
YOU LEARNED HOW TO WALK

824
00:31:09,801 --> 00:31:12,738
THE CATWALK
FROM MISS DIVA EXTRAORDINAIRE

825
00:31:12,738 --> 00:31:13,805
J. ALEXANDER.

826
00:31:13,805 --> 00:31:15,941
AND YOU DID YOUR VERY FIRST
FASHION SHOW.

827
00:31:15,941 --> 00:31:17,709
BUT NOW IT'S TIME FOR
THE JUDGING PANEL TO MAKE

828
00:31:17,709 --> 00:31:19,544
THEIR FOURTH CUT,
WHICH WILL BRING US

829
00:31:19,544 --> 00:31:21,947
ONE STEP CLOSER
IN DETERMINING WHO WILL BE

830
00:31:21,947 --> 00:31:23,682
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

