A PHOTO SPREAD
IN "ELLE" MAGAZINE,

835
00:31:33,458 --> 00:31:35,694
WHICH WILL BE SHOT
BY WORLD-RENOWNED

836
00:31:35,694 --> 00:31:37,929
FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER
