837
00:31:37,929 --> 00:31:42,134
AND A $100,000 CONTRACT
WITH COVER GIRL COSMETICS.

838
00:31:42,134 --> 00:31:44,903
NOW I'M GONNA INTRODUCE
OUR PANEL OF CRAZY-ASS

839
00:31:44,903 --> 00:31:46,972
BUT SO EXCITING JUDGES.

840
00:31:46,972 --> 00:31:48,974
FIRST WE HAVE
MISS JANICE DICKINSON.

841
00:31:48,974 --> 00:31:51,376
JANICE IS ONE OF THE WORLD'S
FIRST SUPER-DUPER MODELS.

842
00:31:51,376 --> 00:31:53,745
NIGEL BARKER, WHO IS A NOTED
FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER.

843
00:31:53,745 --> 00:31:54,813
Nigel: THANK YOU.

844
00:31:54,813 --> 00:31:56,882
Tyra: NOLE MARIN,
