854
00:32:20,672 --> 00:32:21,907
Richie: AND WE DIDN'T
MAKE IT.

855
00:32:21,907 --> 00:32:23,241
Women: (laugh)
J.: OKAY, SO, GIRLS,

856
00:32:23,241 --> 00:32:24,943
GO IN THE BACK AND CHANGE.
THANK YOU.

857
00:32:24,943 --> 00:32:26,244
Janice: WORK IT!

858
00:32:28,713 --> 00:32:31,049
Tyra: NOW IT'S TIME FOR
YOUR INDIVIDUAL EVALUATIONS.

859
00:32:31,049 --> 00:32:33,018
YOU HAD A PHOTO SHOOT
FOR LEE JEANS.

860
00:32:33,018 --> 00:32:36,188
HERE'S THE ACTUAL AD THAT WILL
RUN IN "PEOPLE" MAGAZINE.

861
00:32:36,188 --> 00:32:38,757
Janice: OH, VERY '60s.

862
00:32:38,757 --> 00:32:40,325
VERY ACID-TRIPPY.

863
00:32:40,325 --> 00:32:41,626
I REMEMBER.

864
00:32:42,561 --> 00:32:44,496
Tyra: UP FIRST, CASSIE.

865
00:32:46,698 --> 00:32:48,099
Cassie: I DIDN'T THINK
MY FOOT WAS GONNA GO

866
00:32:48,099 --> 00:32:48,834
IN THIS SHOE.

867
00:32:48,834 --> 00:32:50,268
Nolé: YOU CAN'T LET US
