871
00:32:54,506 --> 00:32:56,007
Tyra: HERE'S YOUR BEST SHOT.

872
00:32:56,007 --> 00:32:56,875
Nolé: CASSIE, I THINK
I THINK THIS IS ONE

873
00:32:56,875 --> 00:32:58,076
OF YOUR BEST PICTURES TO DATE.

874
00:32:58,076 --> 00:32:59,744
Nigel: VERY BROOKE SHIELDS.

875
00:32:59,744 --> 00:33:00,912
Tyra: NICOLE.

876
00:33:03,815 --> 00:33:05,450
Richie: I COULD SEE YOUR FACE
