00:33:26,872 --> 00:33:29,441
THE BEST ATHLETES,
THE BEST DANCERS

885
00:33:29,441 --> 00:33:32,344
AND THE BEST MODELS
PUSH THROUGH THE PAIN.

886
00:33:37,349 --> 00:33:39,117
Nigel: WELL, YOU LOOK
A LITTLE UNCOMFORTABLE HERE.

887
00:33:39,117 --> 00:33:41,253
Janice: KINDA LOOKING LIKE
BREAST EXAM TO ME.

888
00:33:41,253 --> 00:33:42,888
Kelle: OH, GOD, PLEASE, NO.

889
00:33:42,888 --> 00:33:44,890
Tyra: YOUR BODY LOOKS GOOD,
BUT JUST THE FACE--

890
00:33:44,890 --> 00:33:46,258
Kelle: I LOOK LIKE
A PLATYPUS.

891
00:33:46,258 --> 00:33:47,592
Janice: OH, SNAP OUT OF IT.

892
00:33:47,592 --> 00:33:48,960
THIS IS VALUABLE ADVICE
WE'RE GIVING YOU.

893
00:33:48,960 --> 00:33:50,095
Kelle: NO, IT IS, I KNOW.

894
00:33:50,095 --> 00:33:52,464
Janice: OKAY,
SIT THERE AND TAKE IT, HONEY.

895
00:33:52,464 --> 00:33:53,698
Tyra: ANN.

896
00:33:58,336 --> 00:34:00,338
Janice: YOU CAME OUT
LIKE AN EAST GERMAN SWIMMER.

897
00:34:00,338 --> 00:34:01,706
Tyra: YOU HAVE TO LEARN HOW
TO TAKE THE STRENGTH

898
00:34:01,706 --> 00:34:04,075
FROM BEING AN ATHLETE,
BUT THEN GET THE SEX APPEAL

899
00:34:04,075 --> 00:34:05,477
AND THE STOMP
AND THE FIERCENESS

900
00:34:05,477 --> 00:34:06,978
OF BEING A MODEL.

901
00:34:06,978 --> 00:34:07,913
WOW, ANN!

902
00:34:07,913 --> 00:34:08,679
Nigel: YOU LOOK GORGEOUS.

903
00:34:08,679 --> 00:34:10,614
Tyra: I'M LIKE, "OH, MY GOD."

904
00:34:10,614 --> 00:34:11,983
Nigel: I'M LIKE, "THANK GOD."

905
00:34:13,284 --> 00:34:14,485
Tyra: AMANDA.

906
00:34:19,858 --> 00:34:21,025
Nigel: NEVER LOOK DOWN.

907
00:34:21,025 --> 00:34:22,994
DO YOU WEAR GLASSES?
DO YOU WEAR CONTACTS?

908
00:34:22,994 --> 00:34:24,529
Amanda: I HAVE
AN EYE DISEASE.

909
00:34:24,529 --> 00:34:25,797
I'M LEGALLY BLIND.

910
00:34:25,797 --> 00:34:27,899
I'M ASSUMING IN AROUND
FIVE YEARS,

911
00:34:27,899 --> 00:34:30,001
I'M GONNA BE COMPLETELY BLIND.

912
00:34:30,001 --> 00:34:33,071
Janice: OH, I'VE WALKED OFF
OF PLENTY OF RUNWAYS, TRUST ME.

913
00:34:33,071 --> 00:34:34,105
Nigel: NONETHELESS,
THIS IS SOMETHING

914
00:34:34,105 --> 00:34:35,106
YOU WILL HAVE TO DO.

915
00:34:35,106 --> 00:34:36,507
HOWEVER, YOU CAN OVERCOME IT.

916
00:34:37,876 --> 00:34:39,043
Janice: LADY GODIVA.

917
00:34:39,043 --> 00:34:40,344
Nigel: NICE.
IT STILL LOOKS PRETTY GOOD.

918
00:34:40,344 --> 00:34:40,946
Tyra: IT'S EDGY.

919
00:34:40,946 --> 00:34:42,147
Nolé: NO MATTER WHAT ANGLE
YOU SHOOT,

920
00:34:42,147 --> 00:34:43,915
YOU COME ACROSS BEAUTIFUL.

921
00:34:43,915 --> 00:34:45,116
Tyra: KRISTI.

922
00:34:51,089 --> 00:34:52,891
Janice: I THINK
YOU LOOK BORED.

923
00:34:52,891 --> 00:34:54,426
Nigel: I ALMOST BACKED UP
IN MY CHAIR,

924
00:34:54,426 --> 00:34:56,661
BECAUSE I THOUGHT IT WAS LIKE
A TRAIN WRECK COMING TOWARDS ME.

925
00:34:56,661 --> 00:34:58,830
Tyra: THE LAST
VICTORIA'S SECRET FASHION SHOW,

926
00:34:58,830 --> 00:35:00,732
I HAD A SIZE 7 1/2 SHOE.

927
00:35:00,732 --> 00:35:01,900
I WEAR A SIZE 10.

928
00:35:01,900 --> 00:35:03,635
FOR SOME REASON,
WHEN I'M ON THE RUNWAY,

929
00:35:03,635 --> 00:35:05,270
THE PAIN GOES AWAY.

930
00:35:05,270 --> 00:35:07,339
IT'S IMPORTANT TO UNDERSTAND
THE GAME FACE.

931
00:35:07,339 --> 00:35:08,907
Kristi: IT'S, LIKE,
NOT COMING AS FAST

932
00:35:08,907 --> 00:35:09,507
AS I WOULD LIKE.

933
00:35:09,507 --> 00:35:11,276
Tyra: THERE WAS A GROUP SHOT
FOR LEE JEANS,

934
00:35:11,276 --> 00:35:14,045
AND HERE IS YOUR CLOSE-UP.

935
00:35:14,045 --> 00:35:15,480
Nigel: I DON'T KNOW.
IT LOOKS UNCOMFORTABLE.

936
00:35:15,480 --> 00:35:16,715
Tyra: LOOKS A LITTLE CHINISH.

937
00:35:16,715 --> 00:35:17,716
RELAX THAT.

938
00:35:17,716 --> 00:35:19,017
LIKE, YOU'RE LOOKING
AT THE PICTURE RIGHT NOW,

939
00:35:19,017 --> 00:35:20,485
AND YOU LOOK GORGEOUS.

940
00:35:20,485 --> 00:35:21,786
NORELLE.

941
00:35:27,192 --> 00:35:28,660
Janice: ONE LEG, HOP.

942
00:35:31,162 --> 00:35:32,998
Nolé: YOU LOOK LIKE
THE BROKEN TIN MAN.

943
00:35:32,998 --> 00:35:34,499
YOU NEEDED A MAJOR OIL JOB.

944
00:35:34,499 --> 00:35:35,567
I MEAN, AND QUICK.

945
00:35:35,567 --> 00:35:37,369
Norelle: I'VE NEVER
WALKED IN HEELS EVER.

946
00:35:37,369 --> 00:35:39,204
