JUST LOOK A LITTLE STIFF.

975
00:36:37,562 --> 00:36:38,630
YAYA.

976
00:36:45,103 --> 00:36:47,906
Tyra: IT REMINDED ME
OF "COMING TO AMERICA."

977
00:36:47,906 --> 00:36:49,074
YOU HAD YOUR HEAD UP.

978
00:36:49,074 --> 00:36:50,375
