979
00:36:50,375 --> 00:36:52,277
THAT IS NOT MODELING.

980
00:36:52,277 --> 00:36:53,545
HERE'S YOUR BEST SHOT.

981
00:36:53,545 --> 00:36:54,913
Nolé: THAT IS FABULOUS.

982
00:36:54,913 --> 00:36:56,548
Richie: I LOVE IT.
