1004
00:37:39,758 --> 00:37:40,725
Tyra: YAYA.

1005
00:37:40,725 --> 00:37:42,761
Nolé: I DID NOT CARE FOR
THE WAY SHE WORKED

1006
00:37:42,761 --> 00:37:45,096
THE RUNWAY AT ALL,
AND I FELT THAT HER DANCE

1007
00:37:45,096 --> 00:37:46,498
TRAINING WORKED AGAINST HER.

1008
00:37:46,498 --> 00:37:47,265
Tyra: ANN.

1009
00:37:47,265 --> 00:37:48,933
I CAN'T BELIEVE THAT
SHE ACTUALLY TOOK THIS PICTURE.

1010
00:37:48,933 --> 00:37:50,635
DANG, THERE IS SOME
POTENTIAL HERE.

1011
00:37:50,635 --> 00:37:51,603
TOCCARA.

