00:38:16,928 --> 00:38:20,198
Janice: I GET A SENSE
OF CAROL BURNETT WITH THE JAW.

1028
00:38:20,198 --> 00:38:21,366
Tyra: NICOLE.

1029
00:38:21,366 --> 00:38:24,169
Janice: I HAVE A PENCHANT
FOR NICOLE'S FLAMING RED HAIR.

1030
00:38:24,169 --> 00:38:25,370
Tyra: EVA.

1031
00:38:25,370 --> 00:38:28,006
Nigel: SHE'S UNUSUAL.
SHE'S SHORT. SHE'S BOYISH.

1032
00:38:28,006 --> 00:38:30,441
Nolé: EVA IS
MISS GOLDEN DELICIOUS.

1033
00:38:30,441 --> 00:38:32,076
Tyra: CASSIE.
Nigel: SHE'S VERY PRETTY.

1034
00:38:32,076 --> 00:38:32,710
Janice: SHE'S JUST TIRED.

1035
00:38:32,710 --> 00:38:34,712
MAYBE LIKE SHE HASN'T SLEPT
FOR THE LAST MONTH.

1036
00:38:34,712 --> 00:38:36,781
GOD KNOWS I DIDN'T SLEEP
FOR TEN YEARS.

1037
00:38:36,781 --> 00:38:38,049
Tyra: AMANDA.

1038
00:38:38,049 --> 00:38:39,684
Nigel: YOU CAN'T BE BLIND
AND BE WALKING ON CATWALKS.

1039
00:38:39,684 --> 00:38:42,053
Janice: AMANDA'S HANDICAP
IS NOT AN ISSUE FOR ME.

1040
00:38:42,053 --> 00:38:44,355
SHE PHOTOGRAPHS AMAZINGLY.

1041
00:38:44,355 --> 00:38:46,691
Nigel: I'M SORRY. TELL ME AN
AGENT THAT'S GOING TO TAKE ON

1042
00:38:46,691 --> 00:38:47,759
A LEGALLY BLIND MODEL?

1043
00:38:47,759 --> 00:38:48,893
Tyra: JENNIPHER.

1044
00:38:48,893 --> 00:38:50,795
Nolé: MAJOR DISAPPOINTMENT
FOR ME.

1045
00:38:50,795 --> 00:38:52,864
AND I DIDN'T THINK
SHE UNDERSTANDS THIS BUSINESS.

1046
00:38:52,864 --> 00:38:55,233
Richie: I WANNA LOVE HER,
BUT I JUST DON'T FEEL LIKE I DO.

1047
00:38:55,233 --> 00:38:56,568
Janice: BYE-BYE.

1048
00:38:59,504 --> 00:39:02,874
Tyra: THERE ARE 11 BEAUTIFUL
GIRLS STANDING BEFORE ME,

1049
00:39:02,874 --> 00:39:06,311
BUT I ONLY HAVE TEN PHOTOS
IN MY HANDS.

1050
00:39:06,311 --> 00:39:09,714
THESE TEN PHOTOS REPRESENT
THE YOUNG LADIES THAT WILL STILL

1051
00:39:09,714 --> 00:39:11,149
BE IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1052
00:39:11,149 --> 00:39:12,851
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1053
00:39:12,851 --> 00:39:15,954
THE FIRST NAME THAT I'M GOING
TO CALL...

1054
00:39:15,954 --> 00:39:17,422
CASSIE.

1055
00:39:17,422 --> 00:39:19,490
CONGRATULATIONS. YOU'RE STILL
IN THE RUNNING TOWARDS BECOMING

1056
00:39:19,490 --> 00:39:20,592
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1057
00:39:20,592 --> 00:39:21,893
Cassie: THANK YOU.

1058
00:39:21,893 --> 00:39:22,994
Tyra: ANN.

1059
00:39:22,994 --> 00:39:24,963
THIS IS THE BIG SHOCK GIRL.

1060
00:39:24,963 --> 00:39:27,799
THIS PICTURE PROVED
EVERYONE WRONG.

1061
00:39:27,799 --> 00:39:28,533
NICOLE.

1062
00:39:28,533 --> 00:39:29,834
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1063
00:39:29,834 --> 00:39:31,569
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.
Nicole: THANK YOU.

1064
00:39:31,569 --> 00:39:33,504
Tyra: TOCCARA.

1065
00:39:33,504 --> 00:39:35,840
CONGRATULATIONS.
Toccara: THANK YOU.

1066
00:39:35,840 --> 00:39:37,008
Tyra: EVA.

1067
00:39:38,109 --> 00:39:39,277
AMANDA.

1068
00:39:40,945 --> 00:39:42,146
NORELLE.

1069
00:39:43,181 --> 00:39:45,283
CONGRATULATIONS.
Norelle: THANK YOU.

1070
00:39:45,283 --> 00:39:46,551
Tyra: YAYA.

1071
00:39:49,387 --> 00:39:50,955
I HAVE TWO PICTURES LEFT.

1072
00:39:54,292 --> 00:39:56,527
Tyra: KELLE.

1073
00:39:56,527 --> 00:39:58,029
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1074
00:39:58,029 --> 00:39:59,330
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1075
00:39:59,330 --> 00:40:00,832
Kelle: THANK YOU.

1076
00:40:00,832 --> 00:40:03,167
Tyra: WILL JENNIPHER
AND KRISTI PLEASE STEP FORWARD?

1077
00:40:04,802 --> 00:40:08,940
I HAVE ONE PHOTO IN MY HANDS,
AND THIS ONE PHOTO REPRESENTS

1078
00:40:08,940 --> 00:40:11,542
THE GIRL THAT IS STILL
IN THE RUNNING TOWARDS BECOMING

1079
00:40:11,542 --> 00:40:12,677
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1080
00:40:12,677 --> 00:40:14,412
THE GIRL'S NAME THAT
