00:40:14,412 --> 00:40:16,814
MUST IMMEDIATELY RETURN
TO THE APARTMENT,

1082
00:40:16,814 --> 00:40:18,616
PACK YOUR BELONGINGS
AND LEAVE.

1083
00:40:22,186 --> 00:40:25,189
JENNIPHER,
SOMETIMES YOU CAN WANT SOMETHING

1084
00:40:25,189 --> 00:40:28,927
SO BAD, BUT IF YOU CAN'T CONVEY
IT TO SOMEONE ELSE,

1085
00:40:28,927 --> 00:40:32,997
THEN IT DOESN'T COUNT,
BECAUSE THEN THEY CAN'T FEEL IT.

1086
00:40:32,997 --> 00:40:36,434
AND I KNOW YOU WERE TRYING
TO BE CUTE WITH THE "A-N-T-M"

1087
00:40:36,434 --> 00:40:37,969
ON THE BOOTY.

1088
00:40:37,969 --> 00:40:40,338
WELL, IT KINDA FLOPPED.

1089
00:40:40,338 --> 00:40:42,941
KRISTI,
THERE'S AN INSECURITY

1090
00:40:42,941 --> 00:40:45,743
THAT YOU HAVE,
THAT THE JUDGES AREN'T SURE

1091
00:40:45,743 --> 00:40:47,712
IS REPAIRABLE.

1092
00:40:47,712 --> 00:40:51,482
A LOT OF THE JUDGES
ARE CONCERNED WITH YOUR MOUTH.

1093
00:40:51,482 --> 00:40:52,951
I'M NOT SO CONCERNED
WITH YOUR MOUTH.

1094
00:40:52,951 --> 00:40:55,687
EVERY MODEL HAS SOMETHING
THAT IS BEAUTIFUL AND QUIRKY

1095
00:40:55,687 --> 00:40:57,655
