1096
00:41:05,730 --> 00:41:06,931
Tyra: JENNIPHER.

1097
00:41:06,931 --> 00:41:09,033
CONGRATULATIONS.

1098
00:41:09,033 --> 00:41:10,535
YOU'RE STILL
IN THE RUNNING TOWARDS BECOMING

1099
00:41:10,535 --> 00:41:11,970
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1100
00:41:11,970 --> 00:41:13,338
THANKS, KRISTI.

1101
00:41:21,612 --> 00:41:24,615
